    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Say what's on your mind!</h2><br>Freely create memories or dreams in this narrative sandbox. Build sceneries that become the canvas to write your story onto, whatever you wish to share with other players: from fragmented thoughts to whole novels, just build and speak your mind. Create what you wish or explore what others have made, wander through and read their stories. <i>Say</i> is about sharing and communicating, about expressing who you were, are, or wish to be.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873990/extras/e36c12e77339f4c17942e1b7ceac86dd.poster.avif?t=1732799214\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873990/extras/e36c12e77339f4c17942e1b7ceac86dd.webm?t=1732799214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873990/extras/e36c12e77339f4c17942e1b7ceac86dd.mp4?t=1732799214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i>Say </i>cares!</h2><br><i>Say</i> is a game that cares about how you feel, what you want to tell, what you've been through, what your wishes are. Players in <i>Say</i> share these with others in the firm believe that it is in sharing our thoughts and feelings that we can connect with them and others. No person is a monad - it is in the eyes of others that we exist. <i>Say </i>knows that.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873990/extras/c510d83cb0246ec4294a8950e3e5b535.poster.avif?t=1732799214\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873990/extras/c510d83cb0246ec4294a8950e3e5b535.webm?t=1732799214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873990/extras/c510d83cb0246ec4294a8950e3e5b535.mp4?t=1732799214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Join the community!</h2><br><i>Say </i>lets you create atmospheric dioramas that reflect a memory, a mood, a dream. With the help of you, of the commuity, <i>Say </i>will become an endless vault of stories, fragments thoughts and prayers. <i>Say </i>invites you to join in and build a tribe of creative minds, builders, writers, and everyone who longs to share themselves. Be part of the <i>Say </i>Community and speak your mind.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873990/extras/07b3c57de8b46f6a1c5b157d7e1c8802.poster.avif?t=1732799214\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873990/extras/07b3c57de8b46f6a1c5b157d7e1c8802.webm?t=1732799214\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2873990/extras/07b3c57de8b46f6a1c5b157d7e1c8802.mp4?t=1732799214\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
